&_nc_oc=AdpLQQMFGvFvUfgD9MhNzC0-uPDtajCyjm6VNfLaFxWI0ffT61hV6lgcf5wkdFkH2_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCBoL8Ce_j1ASzbmHP4Q0XCXWRCwPuDHsExUPFpqGp4-g&oe=6A60A67E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vDi6Jte4ADMQ7kNvwFCM0N8&_nc_oc=Adq-4xwGm5WClmKVUIDjlFAdUr1uiguGpka_tdAyzsC74hptAifJZ1DZWbzyjCetQKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDn3FXMPDrjS-Fhv-DrY-o0g77pnTM-hCfXpTigjAj0xw&oe=6A60B77C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RthqlXglNTUQ7kNvwHHpBfT&_nc_oc=Adr-qwKJyGbc1N1HSAhcYotq-E7A9ACgL5AEq_uIBAV2HF40JYztamDqwmZjFFqDjW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDn-HFkw8nxjkHSo4aY26aRkeNDkQBEGjQLbBxh4H0P9Q&oe=6A60D607"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zdvav2-TwREQ7kNvwEzltK_&_nc_oc=AdriTuHSbzV8TTPcZZqOEUzsa9z-12dVBYNrAqkfNohg5awy8f371zMKT3Rc0plYZDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDeR0wXYEQmDgBGeAtrD92gM3AlhLlTVTCKXeCCM6FVlg&oe=6A60C1D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qdIKK2E16H0Q7kNvwH4TN9V&_nc_oc=AdocsKF33zU6Y6bF6_fbzlSKv6aYj0C3161hPg7Rk5jMLH2IloK6UKHum-Yi6R7BlNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBh7xd8tmN_DtSi5PSBN2U3IJup8lK6WGE0nFBperG-Cg&oe=6A60CE64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.